Backport ngx.fs from openresty/lua-nginx-module#2489 (oowl).
Upstream revision: d4895bc228e31babf0a1cf229156ca09899da6f6
https://github.com/openresty/lua-nginx-module/pull/2489

Add single-task read_file and append_file operations, allocate read
buffers after dequeueing, and use write for append-mode descriptors.

Protect Lua result creation and harden descriptor ownership, size
validation, and request cleanup.

